# Third-party license manifest

ALFRED's templates directory contains conference style files vendored from
their official sources (listed in SOURCES.md). These files are NOT covered
by the project's root MIT license. Each file retains its original license
as documented below.

A copy of the LaTeX Project Public License (LPPL) v1.3c is included at
templates/LPPL-1.3c.txt.

