## Venue-specific files (distributed by conferences for author use)

These files are provided by their respective conferences as part of
official author kits intended for paper preparation and submission.
They are redistributed here from the sources documented in SOURCES.md.

### NeurIPS (templates/neurips/, templates/neurips2024/, templates/neurips2026/)
- neurips_20*.sty — NeurIPS formatting instructions. No explicit license
  stated. Distributed by NeurIPS for author use.

### CVPR 2026 (templates/cvpr2026/)
- cvpr.sty — CVPR author kit. No explicit license stated.

### ICLR 2026 (templates/iclr2026/)
- iclr2026_conference.sty — ICLR master template. No explicit license stated.

### ICML 2026 (templates/icml2026/)
- icml2026.sty — ICML style file. No explicit license stated.
- algorithm.sty, algorithmic.sty — Copyright 1994 Peter Williams.
  No explicit license stated.

