## System packages (not vendored)

The following standard LaTeX packages are required by some templates but
are NOT bundled in this repository. They are available in TeX Live:

- natbib.sty (LPPL) — used by iclr2026, acl
- fancyhdr.sty (LPPL) — used by iclr2026, icml2026
